## TIẾNG ANH · 16:30–17:00 — Thứ Hai: Daily Standup

### 16:30–16:40 · Shadowing

### 16:40–16:55 · Standup có ghi âm

> *"Morning. Last week was performance — I've got before and after numbers documented for everything, including the changes that made no difference.*
> *This week is offline support and CI. Today I persisted the query cache to disk so the app opens with data even in airplane mode, and wired up network detection.*
> *One detail I hadn't thought about before: there's a difference between being connected and actually reaching the internet. Captive portals — hotel or café wifi where you haven't logged in yet — report as connected, so if you only check that flag, every request hangs until it times out.*
> *Tomorrow I'll add a mutation queue so writes made offline sync when the connection comes back."*

### 16:55–17:00 · 5 từ mới

| Từ / cụm | Nghĩa | Câu mẫu |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `captive portal` | cổng đăng nhập Wi-Fi công cộng | *Captive portals report as connected.* |
| `hang` (v) | treo, không phản hồi | *Every request hangs.* |
| `time out` | hết thời gian chờ | *…until it times out.* |
| `stale data` | dữ liệu cũ | *We show stale data with a timestamp.* |
| `come back` (mạng) | có lại | *…when the connection comes back.* |

